----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var b = 125

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

let x = 0

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

set b = 500

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

let c = b + 1

----------
expect all four units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 500 |
| 2 | - | compiles, runs | new | `x` = 0 |
| 3 | overwrites `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 501 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 2
----------

var b = 7

----------
expect unit 2 shadows `b`
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 3 overwrote unit 1's `b` when it last ran, and now overwrites unit 2's | `b` = 125 |
| 2 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `b` = 500 |
| 3 | overwrites `b` (2) | reruns | its `b` is unit 2's now, of the same type | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (2) | reruns | its `b` is unit 2's now, of the same type | `c` = 501 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 2
----------

let x = 0

----------
expect unit 2 stops shadowing `b`
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | untouched | unit 3 overwrites `b` and needs nothing it held | `b` = 500 |
| 2 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `x` = 0 |
| 3 | overwrites `b` (1) | reruns | its `b` is unit 1's again, of the same type | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | reruns | its `b` is unit 1's again, of the same type | `c` = 501 |
